window.products.push({"id":791069,"name":"Empino 20-Piece Silverware Set Stainless Steel Flatware Set – Service for 4 – Mirror Polished Eating Utensils - Modern Cutlery Set of Dinner Forks, So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41w3BzzdOlL._AC_.jpg","description":"Upgrade Your Kitchen Equipment Tools with The Most Elegant 20-piece Silverware Set Are you tired of buying basic utensil sets that rust easily within the first month of use? Does your tableware set bend easily due to poor quality? Do you want to have a beautiful dining table with simple yet elegant fork spoon and knife set? Introducing Empino Stainless Steel Silverware Set to the rescue! Durable strong construction that will last for years to come Heat-resistant, won't bend and dishwasher safe Well-balanced to fit securely in your hand High quality elegant design Ideal for everyday family use, for inviting friends over or for gourmet dinners. With proper care and a little bit of love, our mirror polished, stainless steel flatware set will feed your family for years to come. Setting the Table A properly set table is a beautiful sight to behold and a time-honored tradition. Whether you want to make everyday dining extraordinary or to create a beautiful setting for a special event, simply follow these guidelines:Flatware should be arranged around a dinner plate according to what's going to be served first. The salad fork is placed on the outermost, left-hand side of the plate, followed by the dinner fork. On the outermost, right-hand side of the plate, the teaspoon is first, followed by the dinner spoon and finally the dinner knife. For more formal occasions, a butter knife is typically placed above the plate for bread and rolls. Package Includes: 4 x Soup Spoons 4 x Dinner Forks 4 x Steak Knives 4 x Salad Forks 4 x Teaspoons","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41w3BzzdOlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empino","source_asin":"B07544RTS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07544RTS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07544RTS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
