window.products.push({"id":791114,"name":"Moiswell 212 Pints Commercial Dehumidifier with Pump and Drain Hose, Crawl Space dehumidifier Basement, Industry Water Damage Unit for up to 8,000 sq ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515PdsonuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for Crawl Space: With a horizontal design and measuring at only 25.5*21*19.8 inch(L*W*H), this compact dehumidifier is perfect to fit in between floor joists, low-clearance crawl spaces and tight basement areas. Commercial Grade Dehumidifie: This Moiswell dehumidifier XP120 with 353 CFM airflow rate removes up to 212 pints of moisture from the air per day in saturated conditions and 120 pints per day in AHAM, powerful enough to cover large spaces up to 8,000 square feet. Dehumidifier with Pump for Easy Drainage: This commercial dehumidifier with an internal pump will automatically drain the condensate out for low-hassle operation. Plus, the 16-foot long drain hose and 16-foot drain vertical height maximize the flexibility of installation. Easy Operation: Simply set the desired humidity value, this crawl space dehumidifier will auto cycle ON/OFF to maintain the desired humidity level, meanwhile auto drain, auto defrost, and auto restart after power outage for the most ever effortless humidity control. Designed with Convenience in Mind: The pump is easy to access for maintenance, also designed with gravity drain and the external pump drain option, ensuring worry-free drainage. The air outlet is duct-able and the remote control (BUY SEPARATELY) is compatible, offering great convenience while installation and operation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515PdsonuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moiswell","source_asin":"B0C2CN77TX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CN77TX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CN77TX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791115,"name":"Prestige Home Fashion Premium 3D Non-Adhesive EVA Privacy Window Film, Non-PVC, 2 ft x 3 ft, Mosaic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wuhFxPfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No mess, no fuss! Prestige Home Fashion's Premium No-Glue Non-Adhesive Privacy EVA Window Film is easy to apply and remove. Our high-quality film is great for privacy while still allowing the sun's natural light to shine through. It blocks the view from outside even at night with all the lights on! Our film is ideal for homes and offices with just the perfect amount of frost. It is also easy to cut to size and shape to fit the film on any window or to make decorative alterations. Little to no maintenance is required after installation! Safe, easy, and effective our privacy film will not disappoint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wuhFxPfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prestige Home Fashion","source_asin":"B01CT9Z162","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CT9Z162","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CT9Z162","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791116,"name":"Magnetic Poetry - Apocalypse Kit - Words for Refrigerator - Write Poems and Letters on The Fridge - Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qF3ZsojvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The end is near and this box of word magnets is ready for it! Includes words like explode, bunker, civilization, bummer, meteor, ammo and wasteland. CONTAINS - over 200 themed magnetic word tiles in a cute, colorful, giftable 4.75 x 3 inch box. Rearrange the words to write poems, messages to your roommates, or generative esoteric word art masterpieces whose meaning is lost even to you. Magnetic Poetry is both a creative writing aid, and just a really fun and limitless toy. They're not just fridge words, you can write an ode on your commode, an elegy on your doorknob, a haiku on your car hood, or a novelette on your omelette maker. MIX AND MATCH WITH OTHER KITS - Tile height is 0.375 Inches, compatible with nearly all other Magnetic Poetry sets. With dozens of other themed kits, the possibilities are endless. You can mix and match to create custom combinations, and custom gift ideas. Magnet words make a great dorm room accessory, or locker decoration. They're also a perfect gift for poetry lovers, or a gift for writers of any kind, and as a graduation present, you can't go wrong. MADE IN THE USA - Magnetic Poetry sets are made in America, are nontoxic, and comply with all American and international safety guidelines and regulations. Magnetic Poetry is the inventor of the magnetic word tile, and we're still a small US company that takes great pride in every set we make. Read more about our company in the product description below. OVER 100 DIFFERENT SETS - Please click on the Magnetic Poetry brand name below the title of this page to browse other sets made by us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qF3ZsojvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnetic Poetry","source_asin":"B01N10CMJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N10CMJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N10CMJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791117,"name":"Crystal Grappa and Cordial Glasses | Set of 6 | Small 3 oz Long Stemmed Spirit Glassware for Liqueur, After Dinner Drink, Aperitif, Digestive | Italia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H85gI1wxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DISCOVER COMPLEX FLAVORS – traditionally shaped into rounded bowls that cinch like an hourglass before flaring out at the top, these classic Italian grappino glasses maximize the nuanced grappa flavor profile. The wide opening allows the sharp alcohol vapors to disperse away while the tulip bulb concentrates its lush olfactory notes before delivering them towards your nose for ultimate nosing and sipping experience. PERFECT SNIFTERS – the very same silhouette and small size make these 3oz long stemmed glasses truly versatile for tasting and enjoying any strong aromatic spirits such as aperitifs, after dinner drinks, digestives, liqueurs, cordials, amaro, aquavit, schnapps, sambuca and even limoncello. Don’t be surprised if you find yourself using these elegant liquor glasses way more than you have anticipated. TIMELESS ELEGANCE – if there is something about a nice glass that makes your drink taste that much better, ours is developed with the help of award-winning glass masters and blown from finest clear crystal glass. Seamless graceful build and dishwasher friendly features also make these tiny snifters not only beautifully refined, but practical as well. SOPHISTICATED GIFT – for birthday, housewarming, wedding, engagement, anniversary, retirement, Father’s or Mother’s Day, for your boss, business partner or simply yourself. Every set of 6 grappa brandy glasses comes neatly packed in our exceptional gift and storage box. The back shares a few tips for serving and tasting while the silky glass shape matching cloth carefully secures each snifter in place to protect from dust, scratching and breaking. HANDBLOWN – all our crystal grappa glasses are hand-blown. Due to this artisanal nature, their imperfections, or the non-uniformity, such as a few tiny bubbles, are to be considered as a characteristic of their value and authenticity, that in no way affect the quality or sturdiness of these beautiful glasses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H85gI1wxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLASSIQUE CADEAU","source_asin":"B08PG45WJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PG45WJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PG45WJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791118,"name":"a Blue Note III Wall Decor by Lisa Audit, 14\" x 14\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917qdfp7quL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features blue flowers in front of a cream background. Lisa audit loves the art of decoration, and she uses oil paints, acrylics, and pen and ink to create beautiful pieces of art. She finds inspiration from fine art masters such as Picasso, Manet, Rubens and Cezanna. Lisa lives in Canada with her two teenage daughters, and she creates much of her artwork in a spacious studio inside her home. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917qdfp7quL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0BP2BVXZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP2BVXZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP2BVXZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
