window.products.push({"id":791122,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Mission Flower 4-Piece Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T3FBN9PRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description The Arts and Crafts era gave birth to gorgeous decorative objects which combined stylized organic motifs and geometric forms with the hallmarks of artisan-crafting. Typical of this time were Mission style homes and furniture. This pattern evokes the soft earthy tones and decorative elements of that period with an ease of care that is perfect for modern living. Amazon.com The rich colors and organic designs of the Mission Flower dinnerware makes it perfect for intimate occasions and comfortably formal meals. This place setting for one combines the pattern's lovely motif with generous proportions and subtle sculptural detailing. At the table, the effect is warm, friendly, and graceful. Crafted from stoneware, the setting includes an 11-1/8-inch dinner plate with a creamy flecked base, a burnt sienna border, and an abundant garland of flowers and vines. The complementary vine pattern on the 8-1/4-inch salad plate is pretty enough to stand on its own and blends well with the rest of the set. A coordinating pattern encircles the 18-ounce mug, and appears in relief on the exterior of the 21-ounce burnt sienna bowl. Safe in the microwave, dishwasher, and freezer, the dishes are covered by Pfaltzgraff's 3-year warranty and can be replaced individually. --Emily Bedard Whats in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting consists of: 11-1/8-inch dinner plate; 8-1/4-inch salad plate; 21-ounce bowl; 18-ounce mug. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T3FBN9PRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B0000AHULS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000AHULS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000AHULS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791123,"name":"Sorbus Magnetic Knife Bar Strg Strip, Black, 22 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ERU08SljL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Need help storing your best kitchen knives? Keep them handy, right in arms reach with Sorbus Magnetic Knife Holder! This amazingly lightweight yet extremely powerful knife bar keeps knives at hand without the hassle of rummaging through drawers. The knife holder is able to keep knives and other metal tools snatched and separated through two magnetic strips lining the bar. Knives and other metal accessories stay in place without slipping or sliding! Your home accessories or work tools will fasten quickly and securely to the magnetic bar but easily release when needed. This spacious 22 inch magnetic knife holder can be used in the kitchen, workshop, office, or garage. It is a practical and convenient way to store knives, cutlery, and other metal tools. It also saves valuable drawer space providing more convenient access to your cutlery. Packing away knives and other sharp objects in drawers may lead to accidental cuts and injuries while searching for a particular item. This can also cause the knives to deteriorate much faster by rubbing against other metal tools and causing them to lose their sharpness. This magnetic knife holder solves all those issues by allowing you to stock all your favorite knives in one place while creating more storage space! It mounts directly onto any flat surface wall for immediate access. Purchase multiple magnetic knife holders, which can be installed side by side, for additional storage space. Knife bar can be wiped clean using a damp cloth and mild dish detergent for years of use. Need a last minute gift?! Sorbus Magnetic Knife Holder makes a great gift for the aspiring culinary artist in your life! The holder measures approximately 22x2 (LxW). Instructions: 1. Measure space between the two screws on the knife bar 2. Drill two holes on the wall according to space available 3. Put screws into the holes in the wall 4. Place knife bar onto wall and fix screws making sure the alignment is correct on each side","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ERU08SljL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sorbus","source_asin":"B019EM0NZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019EM0NZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019EM0NZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791124,"name":"Old World Christmas Assortment Glass Blown Ornaments for Christmas, Tree of Life","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JwQEb6oCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Many cultures around the world embrace this symbol. Common meanings include one's connection to all things, nature and world, as well as family and ancestors. The Tree also symbolizes an individual s personal growth, as well as rebirth, a fresh start, immortality, growth and strength.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JwQEb6oCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old World Christmas","source_asin":"B07ZGD17QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZGD17QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZGD17QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791125,"name":"Ambesonne Cat Bench Pad, Hipster Nerd Characters with Vintage Sunglasses Intelligent Feline Serious Expressions, Standard Size HR Foam Cushion with De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MDQOtrD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STANDARD SIZE - 45\" W x 15\" L x 2\" H. Soft and comfy bench cushion for kitchen, patio, home decor.FEATURES - High-quality foam pad inserts. Removable and washable fabric cover with decorative print.MADE FROM - Comfortable high resilience (HR) foam with 100% Polyester, WATERPROOF fabric cover.VERSATILE - Fits the bench in every room in your home. Can be used indoor and outdoor. Very durable.EASY CARE - MACHINE WASHABLE removable cover. Stain resistant. Has zipper for hassle-free cleaning.Ambesonne bench pillow with high resilience foam and a washable removable cover. The foam has no chemical odor and harmful materials in it. You can take the cover out and wash it very easily. Wash on a delicate/cold cycle and iron it on low heat. So long as you follow the care instructions the dye will not fade and you will have a long-lasting decorative and comfortable accent piece. Perfect present for your mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter and all other loved ones. You can save yourself some trouble by opting out one of the thousands of designs for a gift idea. Our products have a great variety of color, hues and patterns so you can surely find something you'll like in no time. The prints are made with up to date presses and utilizing the latest technology we can deliver you only the best goods possible. The products we provide goes great in the kitchen seats, entryway, porch swing, front porch, hall bench and any seating area. So this is a very versatile product. You can use it almost everywhere. Living room, bathroom, and bedroom. You will find nothing but comfy cushions that looks incredible. After receiving the item, we advise you to air it our for a day and let the foam expand. The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible, however, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MDQOtrD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B08WHBMP32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WHBMP32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WHBMP32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791126,"name":"Spectrum Diversified Wall Mount or Adhesive Sink Plastic Grocery Storage & Trash Bag Organization, Standard, Light Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DQgx18C4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reduce, reuse, recycle! The handy Cabinet & Wall Mount Recycling Bag Holder gives you a place to neatly store unruly plastic grocery bags. Store your old plastic grocery bags so you can reuse them. This organizer keeps them together and mounts to a wall or the inside of a cabinet to keep them out of the way yet within easy reach. The wide opening at the top of the grocery bag holder allows you to easily insert the unruly plastic bags into the organizer. Large opening at the bottom makes it easy to grab a plastic bag to reuse as a trash bag, pet poop bag, or other uses. The hard plastic construction will compress bags, minimizing how much space your old grocery bags take up in your home. The slim cutout allows for slight expansion to accommodate more bags. Holes are drilled for easy mounting; simply insert the screws into the holes and a pre-drilled hole in the wall and tighten until the plastic bag organizer feels firmly fastened. If you don’t have any tools or don’t want to drill into your walls, no worries! Alternatively, use the included adhesive stickers to attach organizer to the wall or cabinet door. Wipe both surfaces before applying adhesive tape. Made of durable plastic. Mounting hardware and adhesive included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DQgx18C4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B0BBNBTWZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBNBTWZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBNBTWZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
