window.products.push({"id":791388,"name":"Zesliwy Navy Blue Silver Balloons Garland Kit, 131 pcs Navy Blue White Silver Confetti Balloons Arch Kit for Birthday Party Baby Shower Wedding Gradua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ydHuewE6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superior Quality】:Navy blue silver balloons garland kit are made with natural latex material. Every balloons have been rigorously tested and selected manually. it thicker than other balloons, the color is shiny and not easy to explosive, They are safe to be used for both kids and adult. 【Important Notice】: Pls be noted the navy blue color balloons looks like black color before they are blow up, but they are dark blue color after they blow up.After you received the package, pls don't worry and unpack the package, then blow them up. and you will find they are blue color NOT BLACK COLOR. 【Valuable Package】:These blue silver balloons arch kit including 131pcs navy blue, silver confetti, silver metallic and white balloons in 18\",12\",10\",5\" size, one roll stripe tape and 100 pcs balloons stikcer ,very easy to DIY a beautiful balloons garland kit. 【DIY Balloon Garland】: The navy blue balloons garland kit is easy to DIY a beautiful balloons garland with the tools we are offering. simply inflate your balloons and slip the knot into the holes on the decorating strip, recommend various colors and blow up different sizes to get a amazing look to your garland.This will be a happy DIY time for the family and friends. 【Widely Applications】: The blue silver balloons garland kit suit for widely parties, Perfect for birthday, baby showers, weddings, anniversaries, celebrations, graduation, opening ceremonies, corona beer party decorations. Decorate any party indoor or outdoor as a photo booth backdrop. 【Without Riskly】: If you have any questions or problems with our product, please don’t hesitate to contact us.We will solve the problem for you until you are satisfied. If at any time you are not completely satisfied with your purchase feel free to return it to us for a full and prompt refund- No Questions.Your risk level is 0.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ydHuewE6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zesliwy","source_asin":"B0BZYKDRY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZYKDRY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZYKDRY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791389,"name":"Fittia Bamboo Pillowcases Set of 2, Organic Bamboo Cooling Pillow Cases for Hot Sleepers, Soft Silky Bamboo Pillow Cases Queen Size with Envelope Clos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NDL12mpsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eco-friendly Lyocell Bamboo Fabric: Fittia bamboo pillow cases are made from 100% biodegradable natural cellulose found in bamboo pulp. Unlike bamboo-derived rayon or bamboo viscose, the manufacturing process of Lyocell bamboo pillowcases does not create by-products harmful to health or planet earth. Non-toxic and environmentally friendly. Silky Touch & Breathable: Lyocell bamboo cooling pillow cases have a very smooth surface that drapes beautifully just like silk pillowcases. The wicking properties of bamboo pillowcases keep skin and hair cool all night long. This makes our pillowcase a perfect choice for people suffering from night sweat and those with sensitive skin. Ideal cooling pillow cases for hot sleepers and those who live in humid climates. Durable & Ultra-Strong: Bamboo cooling pillowcase has a lower friction level than cotton pillowcases. Along with its anti-static nature, sleeping on lyocell bamboo pillow cases reduces sleep creases and split ends. It is fairly easy to maintain as it will not wrinkle, shrink or fade when washed. Double stitching on the side is designed to extend its life for use. Will not rip or come apart at the seams. Envelope Closure Design: 7'' attached hem on one side of the envelope pillowcase holds pillow securely in place during your sweet dreams, preventing it from sliding out. No need to wake up in the middle of the night to adjust your pillowcase. Easy on and off with no zipper. Easy Care: Hand wash and dry flat in shade are highly recommended. Machine washable on gentle cycle using cold water (preferably in a mesh bag). Tumble dry and iron on low heat setting. Please use mild detergent and do not bleach. If you have any questions, feel free to contact us through email. We will get back to you within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NDL12mpsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fittia","source_asin":"B09G5PRDYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G5PRDYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G5PRDYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
