window.products.push({"id":791541,"name":"A-Grade Palo Santo Sticks - Palo Santo Incense - Palo Santo Smudge Sticks Bulk Lot for Cleansing, Smudging, Meditation and Purification (1/2 Pound)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10yYlFBu5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our favorite way to use these Palo Santo Sticks: Light the palo santo at an angle to allow the flame to move upwards.  After 30 seconds to a minute blow out the flame  Continue to smudge your space, body or crystals  When finished, put out the wood in fire proof container What can you use the sacred incense for: Cleansing a new home, office or space  Clearing your crystals of energy  Improving the scent of a room  Known to reduce stress and anxiety  Aides with meditation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10yYlFBu5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beverly Oaks","source_asin":"B07HB9JLC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HB9JLC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HB9JLC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791542,"name":"IC International Concepts International Concepts Keystone Accent Table, Heather Grey-Antique Washed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":105.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gT0TmKDhL._AC_.jpg","description":"International Concepts home furniture is a beautiful collection of high quality, wood furniture with a traditional and elegant look. Featuring pieces, you will be proud of for years to come and that will easily complement any decor. All pieces are manufactured from solid parawood which is more commonly referred to as Rubberwood. Parawood is eco-friendly in terms of being a fantastic renewable resource. As parawood is considered to be a hardwood, it is actually a truly durable and strong wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gT0TmKDhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IC International Concepts","source_asin":"B08WR6SMH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WR6SMH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WR6SMH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791543,"name":"Elegant Disposables Twist Top Containers Small Food Storage Containers Blue Screw on Lid Reusable Stackable Leakproof Airtight, Pack of 10-4 oz Contai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NtOMUsBPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant Disposables brings you top quality and practical plastic food storage containers with blue lids. These storage containers have screw on lids, are leak and spill resistant, freezer safe, microwave and dishwasher safe, and reusable. Perfect for storing soup, cut fruit, purees, applesauce, homemade baby food, salads and more. Food and storage containers are also suitable for organizing and storing dry food like coffee, sugar, beans and pasta, also great for non food items around the house like crafts, toys, slime, beads, tools and more. Pack of 10 1/2 cup containers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NtOMUsBPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Disposables","source_asin":"B0BDNLV238","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDNLV238","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDNLV238","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":791544,"name":"Kirby Vacuum Neutral Drive N D Pedal Switch Lever G4, G5, G6, UG","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tmGYv8ViL._AC_SL1284_.jpg","description":"Kirby Vacuum Neutral / Drive Pedal. To Remove Cover Assembly and Transmission:A. Remove the handle, floor nozzle and emtor from power unit.B. Remove scuff plate by: 1. Remove the screw at the top of the scuff plate for the cord clip. 2. Insert a flat screwdriver into the slot above the switch pedal and lift. 3. While applying downward pressure to the top of the scuff plate carefully slide it to the rear of the power unit. Once the clips at top of scuff plate are free you can lift it off.C. Remove cover casting by: 1. Raise the headlight cap and remove the two flat screws at the front of the cover casting. 2. Remove two screws at the rear of the cover. (These were under the scuff plate) 3. Lift the cover casting off.D. Remove the on/off foot pedal by: 1 Inserting a thin flat bladed screwdriver under the pivot points of the on/off pedal and pry them off the pivot pins. 2. Carefully lift the on/off foot pedal up and out of the power unit until sufficient clearance is available to slide the power switch actuating rod out of foot pedal. Leave the rod connected to the power switch.E: Removing the Transmission: 1 Turn the power unit over, and remove the three screws holding the transmission in. two of the screws are near the back wheels, and the third screw is centered, but is three inches from the back of the power unit. DO NOT remove the center screw that is at the back of the power unit. 2. While supporting the transmission turn the power unit over. 3. Set the N/D pedal in drive. 4. Lower the transmission a little to get some slack in the drive belt, then remove the drive belt. 5. Make sure the power switch actuating rod is pointing upward, then remove the transmission from the power unit.F Removing the Neutral Drive Pedal. 1 Observe how the N/D pedal fits into the bracket cam assembly frame in front of it. 2. Remove the remaining screw in the bottom of the transmission. 3. Remove the N/D Pedal Assembly by lifting up and back. congratulations!G. Assembly is in reverse","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tmGYv8ViL._AC_SL1284_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kirby","source_asin":"B00L0LZAAI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L0LZAAI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L0LZAAI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
