window.products.push({"id":791553,"name":"20pcs Fake Tulips Artificial Flowers for Decoration. Fake Flowers Artificial Tulip Bouquet Real Touch PU Faux Flowers for Valentines Day Anniversary H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b0CUJY0RS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌷20PCS ARTIFICIAL FLOWERS FOR DECORATION: 20pcs fake tulips, add beauty and elegance to your landscape. These vibrant real touch flowers can also match roses, pompom mummy flowers, baby breath and hydrangeas. Full height: 13.4 inches/34cm; Flower head diameter: 1.4 inches/3.5 cm; Flower Head Height: 1.8 inches/4.5cm. 🌷SEND TULIP BOUQUETS AS GIFTS: Tulips can symbolize perfect love, passion, romance, elegance, happiness, friendship.A bouquet of tulips makes a lovely gift to your friends and loved ones on many occasions, makes great gifts for women, girlfriend, wife, sister, mom, wife on Valentines Day, Mothers Day, Birthday, Celebrations,Wedding, Anniversary, etc. 🌷 PREMIUM MATERIAL & EASILY ADJUSTABLE: AirCover faux flower is made of high quality PU latex, feel soft and real, no smell and eco-friendly. The stem is made of steel wire inside and plastic outside so you can easily bend it. You can easily adjust the height of the flowers by cutting the stem with cutting pliers or bending it by your hand. 🌷 LONG-LASTING, NON-ALLERGENIC & GUEST-READY: The artificial flowers look vibrant and they will never wither and remains beautiful all year round. People who are allergic to real flowers can keep them at any space without worrying about a potential reaction. And you won’t have to worry about any guests who might have allergies too. 🌷 MULTI-PURPOSE USES: Use AirCover fake tulip flowers for home, kitchen, living room, centerpiece, office, shop, party, festival, garden, hotel, table decorations, wedding decorations, etc. The artificial tulips can also be used as photography props to create a simple INS style. DIY the unique style you want, and enjoy the joy of doing it yourself. 🌷LOW MAINTEANANCE: Lifelike faux flowers are much easier to care for, best choice for people who like flowers but have no time to deal with real fresh flowers. Keep your artificial flowers lovely by wiping the dust off with a damp rag or wet wipes. To remove dust in the tricky areas like between the petals, a hairdryer on a low setting also does the job.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b0CUJY0RS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aircover","source_asin":"B091Y51JFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091Y51JFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091Y51JFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
