window.products.push({"id":791585,"name":"Marchpower Foldable Travel Fan, 10\" Recharger 7200mAh Battery Operated Portable Osciallating Pedestal Fan with Remote Control, Quiet 5-Speed Foldaway ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CjiApfLCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔋Recharger battery operated foldable fan: The Marchpower collapsible standing fan runs on a 7200mAh rechargeable battery, can be used not only indoors but also outdoors throughout the year, wirelessly for 5-28 hours after fully charged (the available time depends on the wind speed ). 🎑Super Quiet 5 wind levels speed foldaway fan: Marchpower portable fan equipped with QuietSet technology, 13-25dB allow you to enjoy a peaceful sleeping. There are 5 gears wind speed modes for choice, set the speed according to the temperature around you. The foldaway fan complement the existing air con system create a comfortable environment in your home with a pleasant \"wind chill effect\". 📱Remote control & timer pedestal fan: Remote control allows you to adjust the pedestal fan settings from a distance (within 4.5m) without having to get up and manually adjust the fan. It also includes a timer setting, allowing you to set it to turn on and off at a certain times, you can choose 1, 2, 4, 8 hours. ❄️10\" large enough & 90°Oscillating Foldable Fan: The foldaway fan with 10-inch size adopts strong wind vortex design, strong wind can reach 16.5 feet. The summer fan also oscillates (90°) to circulate air throughout the entire room and has a slim profile, which is a convenient way to keep yourself cool, without getting a chill. Since the stream of air will not constantly be on your skin, your body will hold on to a reasonable amount of heat, keeping you at an optimal temperature. 🎁Compact portable fan: The Marchpower compact fan with unique foldaway & telescopic design, the height of the foldable floor fan can be fully adjusted from 5” to 36”, 10\" in diameter, 9\"x9\"x5.6\" folded size, 16\"~36\" adjustable height, it can be used as table fan, floor fan or pedestal fan. Thanks to the folding abilities its convenient to store and save space. Perfect for home, shop, office, restaurant, and sometimes, even small spaces inside homes. 🍃Air circulating cooling fan: The Marchpower table fans belong to circulating fans category. As we read on the U.S. Department of Energy website, circulating fans include pedestal fans, table fans, floor fansand fans mounted to walls. They complement the existing air con system and natural ventilation and create a comfortable environment in your home with a pleasant \"wind chill effect\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CjiApfLCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marchpower","source_asin":"B0BYNM1T66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYNM1T66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYNM1T66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
