window.products.push({"id":791682,"name":"FlyfreeU Portable USB Heated Blanket, Wearable Electric Heated Throw Blanket with 3 Heating Levels,56'' x 45'' Thickened Heated Camping Blanket for Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Ct176OoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【USB Heated Portable Blanket】This heated throw blanket has built-in USB cable, it convenience to be powered by a power adapter or power bank (not included), it is comes with 6FT extension cable, can feel free to plug in any USB port, the USB heated throw is perfect for outdoor activities like camping, traveling or watching sports events. it is also suitable for use at home, in the office, in the car. TIPS: The power supply must be 5V / 2A or above to ensure the best heating effect. 【3 Heating Level】With fast heating technology, the portable USB heated throw blanket warms you up quickly. NOTE: The switch button and USB cable are in the side pocket of the blanket. Insert the USB cable into the power supply (not included), long press switch button for 3 seconds to switch on, then you can adjust 3 temperature settings, (switch at the touch of switch button) red LED for High, white for Medium, blue for Low, when not in use, long press switch button for 3s to switch off. 【Portable Wearable Heating Blanket】Transform your heated blanket throw into a compact sleeveless jacket in seconds. There are two hidden zippers in the middle of the blanket, when zipper is closed, it is a thick blanket or shawl. Unzipped it, you can wear it like a sleeveless jacket. With multi-button design, it is very warm to wear. This wearable heated blanket is necessary for parties in cold weather, windy stadiums and cool nights outside. No more shivering with the cold. 【Windproof Material & Machine Washable】Our heated camping blanket surface is made of premium windproof fabric, the lining is soft and warm flannel. It can prevent heat loss perfectly and keep you warm even in cold days. Durable double stitched fabric, which can be enjoyed for a long time. This blanket is 30% thicker than other heated outdoor blankets, luxuriously soft.This heating travel blanket is easy to clean and can be machine washed. Please disconnect and remove power supply before washing. 【A Warm Gift】The size of USB electric blanket is 56'' x 45'', Weight: 1.92 lbs, it is large and lightweight, suitable for both adults and kids. It can be used as a heated blanket, a heated shawl or a heated jacket at any time. If the weather is not so cold, you can also use it as an ordinary blanket without using its heating function. So it can be used not only in winter, but also in other seasons.The portable USB heated blanket will be a considerate gift for yourself, your family and friends. 【Worry-free Service Guarantee】- Package includes: 1 x USB heated portable blanket, 1 x 6FT extension cable. No need to worry about RETURN or REFUND, We guarantee this electric heated blanket 100% money back or free exchange. If you have any questions or need any support, please feel free to contact us, we will offer you a satisfactory solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-Ct176OoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FlyfreeU","source_asin":"B0BCHY1P6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCHY1P6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCHY1P6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
