window.products.push({"id":791806,"name":"ICHC Set of 4 Collapsible Storage Containers - Space Saving Food Silicone Containers, Flat Stacks, Travel Containers, Air Tight Lunch Box With Lids, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71piLG0kTpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Background: ICHC is a family owned brand and the brand name comes from our children’s initials. Food and health are top priority for our family and we want to bring the same values to our customers with our top-quality products. We are taking an initiative to create Eco-friendly and practical items to help give our children a brighter future with one sustainable product at a time. Specifications: Clear wrapped package includes 4 containers with 4 lids and 4 air valves. Dimensions & Colors: Small= 350ml (11oz) ----------- 13.2 x 9.8 x 2.7cm --- (Blueberry) Medium= 540ml (18oz) ------- 16.5 x 11 x2.8cm ---- (Guava) Large= 800ml (27oz) ----------- 18.5 x 12 x 3cm ----- (Avocado) Extra Large = 1200ml (40oz) – 21.8 x 14 x 3.2cm -- (Blueberry) Material: Lid – Made of food grade plastic that is BPA free and food safe. Each lid includes a premium silicone air valve. Container – Made of top-quality food grade silica gel. Use & Maintenance: Safe for: Microwave, Dishwasher, Freezer Avoid the use of sharp objects/knives on the product. Avoid putting extreme pressure on the containers when full. Easy to clean. Can wash with warm water and soap or throw it in the dishwasher for a hassle-free experience. Recommend pulling out the air vent valve on the lid or remove the lid prior to heating for best meal heating experience. Check the air valve is pushed back in all the way prior to snapping the lid on the container for best sealing pressure. Eco-Friendly: ICHC containers are reusable and excellent for taking home leftovers from a night out, camping, everyday lunch use. Can help save the planet from single use containers. Warranty: Each set comes with a manufacturer warranty, so you can buy with confidence. If for any reason you are unsatisfied with our containers, we’ll be happy to replace or issue a 100% refund. You can","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71piLG0kTpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICHC","source_asin":"B09B9HPPSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B9HPPSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B9HPPSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
