window.products.push({"id":791887,"name":"Mosuch Baster with a Large Bulb for Improved Retention 11 Inch 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414eVjAlwNL._AC_.jpg","description":"There is no better smell in the kitchen than a good turkey or ham while it roasts in the oven, steaming in its own juices.  Every time someone walks by, they breathe in and enjoy the scent of the dinner that is coming up.   However, to keep that dish as moist as you need it, the key is to keep basting.  The Good Living baster helps you coat your delicious dish flavorful without drying out as it cooks.   The rubber grip makes it easy to hold on as you suction some of the juices in the pan and then let it drip over the meat.  Every guest at the table will be grateful for your dedication to this dish when it comes time to divvy up the servings.  Add this utensil to your kitchenware to keep your meats nice and moist every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414eVjAlwNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mosuch","source_asin":"B01MRTTNN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRTTNN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRTTNN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
