window.products.push({"id":791935,"name":"ALACRIS Vacuum Sealer Machine, 5 in 1 Automatic Food Saver with Detachable Cutter, 7mm Sealing Strip & Dual Pumps, Compact and Easy to Clean for Food ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qIxxMjEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥑【Fresh sealing】This vacuum sealing machine has 145W high power, strong suction power, 7mm wide body heating wire, and better sealing effect. The maximum sealing size is 31.5CM, and the bag can be sealed wider. Effectively prolong the preservation time of food and preserve the freshness and taste of food. 🦐【Simple operation】Equipped with cutter, single and double pump vacuum and dry and wet vacuum mode and sealing device, all the functions you need are included. Just touch the corresponding button, you can achieve one-button vacuum sealing, no need to select another button. 🥝【5 Functional Modes】This machine is equipped with 5 functional modes: automatic dry/wet mode, seal only mode, manual vacuum mode and external vacuum mode, suitable for meat, fish, fruits and vegetables, snacks, etc. 🥦【3-level temperature control】ALACRIS vacuum sealing machine has three adjustable sealing temperatures of low temperature, standard and high temperature. You can adjust the sealing temperature according to different sealing needs; at the same time, the adjustable sealing temperature also makes the sealing operation safer. 🥩【Detachable base】The design of the detachable flushing base prevents liquid from entering the inside of the machine during use and causing damage to the circuit board. And it is convenient to clean the food residue and liquid that leaked during the sealing process after use. 🍕【What you will get】ALACRIS vacuum sealing machine×1, 20×25 (cm) pattern bag×15, external vacuum hose×1, user manual×1. ✔️\"Dry VAC\" and \"Wet VAC\" buttons are automatic vacuum sealing buttons, under Dry VAC function, two clicks to achieve fast vacuuming. ❗NOTE: The \"VAC\" button on the operation panel is a manual vacuum button, you can long press this button to control the vacuum level you want, and then click the \"SEAL\" button to seal bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qIxxMjEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALACRIS","source_asin":"B0BGLHPTTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGLHPTTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGLHPTTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
