window.products.push({"id":791994,"name":"Alarm Clock for Bedroom, Modern Digital Clock for Living Room, 8.7\" LED Mirror Alarm Clock with 2 USB Charger,Snooze,12/24H,7 Adjustable Dimmer & Volu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o1-FMZxaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀ 【LARGE MIRROR DISPLAY & MODERN DESIGN】Features with the super large 8.7 inches LED screen, the big number on the 𝗺𝗶𝗿𝗿𝗼𝗿 𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 is easy to check anywhere in the room or even for senior and the near sighted. Unique PC mirror technology also make the clock can be used as a mirror for your beauty and makeup. Moreover, the sleek design can match with any decoration, not only works for bedroom, office and living room, also a unique gift for your kids, families or friends. 💡 【7-LEVEL BRIGHTNESS & CONVENIENT USB CHARGING】Unlike those commonly seen on the market with only low, medium and high level brightness clocks, this 𝗱𝗶𝗴𝗶𝘁𝗮𝗹 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸𝘀 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗹𝗶𝘃𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗿𝗼𝗼𝗺 𝗱𝗲𝗰𝗼𝗿 provides 7-level brightness to ensuring your maximum visual comfort and a pleasing sleep at night. It's both a clock and a USB charging station. Extra 2 USB port allow you to charge your mobile phone or other smart device simultaneously without plug into any wall outlet, handy and organized. ⏰ 【DUAL ALARM & SNOOZE MODE】Considering that everyone have different schedules despite being a family, we designed this 𝗴𝗼𝗹𝗱 𝗱𝗶𝗴𝗶𝘁𝗮𝗹 𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 with dual alarms, allows you to set 2 separately alarms on the same day. In addition, the big snooze button on the top can help you turn off the buzzer easily without opening eyes and enjoy extra 9 minutes of sleep. The alarm will go off again in 9mins to prevent you oversleeping, perfect 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗵𝗲𝗮𝘃𝘆 𝘀𝗹𝗲𝗲𝗽𝗲𝗿𝘀 or deep sleepers. 🔊【7 LEVELS VOLUME & 12/24H MODE & DST】No harm “beep” alarm sound volume has 7 levels of choice to meet the needs of different groups of people. The maximum level is up to 110 decibels which is loud enough to wake you up timely and easily from deep sleeping. Moreover, this 𝗹𝗲𝗱 𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗲 𝗱𝗶𝘀𝗽𝗹𝗮𝘆 also support 12/24H format and DST function, simply hold press \"12H/24H\" key to switch military time or standard time according to your reading habits. 🔌 【DC ADAPTER INCLUDED & POWER-OFF MEMORY】This is a plug-in clock that requires to run on electricity. The package contains a charging cable and DC adapter to power the 𝗲𝗹𝗲𝗰𝘁𝗿𝗶𝗰 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 and avoid the trouble of additional purchases. When the power is off unexpectedly, the button cell battery built into the 𝗹𝗲𝗱 𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 can automatically save time & alarm settings (the time is not displayed), no need to reset the time and alarm again when main power returns. ❤ 【EASY TO USE & 100% SATISFACTION WARRANTY】With the optimized functional design, this 𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗿𝗺 𝗰𝗹𝗼𝗰𝗸 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗨𝗦𝗕 𝗰𝗵𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗲𝗿 is super easy to operate even for the little kids or the elderly who are not familiar with electronic equipment. You wil get: 1 x digital alarm clock + 1 x USB charging cable + 1 x DC adapter + 1 x product manual + 30 days unconditional refund /exchange + 1 year warranty.( If you have any problem, please contact us without hesitation )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o1-FMZxaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roxicosly","source_asin":"B0B1DC9VK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-791994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DC9VK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DC9VK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
